## Deployment Instructions

To deploy the changes:
1. Update `main.py`, `scanner.py`, and `serialServer.js`.
2. Copy `scanner.service` to `/etc/systemd/system/scanner.service` on the Pi.
3. Reload, enable, and start the systemd service on the Pi:
   ```bash
   sudo systemctl daemon-reload
   sudo systemctl enable scanner.service
   sudo systemctl restart scanner.service
   ```

